\par \hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 The dk.nita.saml20.Logging.AuditLogging class is responsible for audit logging events in the framework. The class uses the configured implementation of the IAuditLogger interface\hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 
 and thereby provides a plug-in design allowing other different implementations for audit logger.
\par 
\par \hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 The AuditLogging class uses a System.Diagnostics Trace as default audit logger implementation if no configuration has been applied.
\par 
\par \hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 The dk.nita.saml20.ext.a\hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 udit.log4net project supplies a log4net implementation of the IAuditLogger interface.  
\par 
\par \hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 The web.config file for the demo service provider shows an example of setting up log4net logging to a file, but log4net can also log to relational databases etc.
\par \line \hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 The \hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 example is shown here (remember to configure the auditLoggingType attribute of the Federation element to use to log4net implementation):
